// Engine messages; diagnostic traces remain verbatim.
"Could not find or open the LaunchServices cache (iOS refused access)." = "无法找到或打开 LaunchServices 缓存（iOS 拒绝访问）。";
"Found a LaunchServices cache but could not open its store (%@)." = "找到了 LaunchServices 缓存，但无法打开对应的数据库（%@）。";
