"Could not read the cache (errno %d)." = "无法读取缓存（错误码 %d）。";
"The cache is empty or too large." = "缓存为空或过大。";
"The cache format does not match a verified layout. Nothing was changed." = "缓存格式与已验证布局不匹配，未进行修改。";
