"iOS did not allow opening the cache for writing (errno %d)." = "iOS 不允许以写入方式打开缓存（错误码 %d）。";
"lsd just changed or locked the cache. Please try again." = "lsd 刚刚修改或锁定了缓存，请重试。";
"The write could not be verified; the original bytes were restored." = "写入未通过验证，已恢复原始字节。";
